<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-5 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">About Khems Cleaning</h2>
  <p class="text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Khems Cleaning Services</strong> provides residential and commercial cleaning, coordinating a mobile team of cleaners against a constantly shifting schedule of bookings, cancellations, and one-off requests.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The challenge</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Booking and scheduling ran through phone calls and manual calendar updates. As demand grew, the team hit a ceiling on how many bookings they could take without adding scheduling staff &mdash; and double-bookings and gaps in coverage were common.
  </p>
  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-6">
    <p class="mb-2 font-medium text-[#111827]">Key pain points:</p>
    <ul class="space-y-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
      <li>&bull; Manual scheduling capped how many bookings could be handled</li>
      <li>&bull; Double-bookings and scheduling gaps happened regularly</li>
      <li>&bull; Staff spent significant time on phone-based booking instead of service delivery</li>
      <li>&bull; Last-minute cancellations were hard to fill efficiently</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The solution</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Khems Cleaning implemented Zunkiree's AI booking system to handle scheduling automatically &mdash; matching bookings to available cleaners, filling cancellations from a waitlist, and letting customers book directly without a phone call.
  </p>
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Automated scheduling</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Bookings are matched to available cleaners automatically, without a scheduler manually checking calendars.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Self-serve booking</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Customers book directly online, removing the phone-call bottleneck for routine requests.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-5 shadow-subtle">
      <p class="mb-1 font-medium text-[#111827]">Cancellation backfill</p>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#6B7280]">Cancelled slots are automatically offered to a waitlist instead of sitting empty.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">The results</h2>
