<div class="mb-12" data-reveal>
  <h2 class="mb-4 text-[26px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight text-[#111827] md:text-[30px]">Why it mattered</h2>
  <p class="mb-5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280] md:text-[17px]">
    Hiring another scheduler would have added capacity to answer the phone, not capacity to actually fill the calendar well. Khems Cleaning needed the matching and the backfill to happen automatically, the moment a booking or a cancellation came in &mdash; not sometime later, after a person got around to checking the calendar.
  </p>
  <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#76B900] pl-4 text-[15px] italic leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">
    &ldquo;Every empty slot on the calendar was money we'd already lost. We needed something filling it in real time, not a person catching up at the end of the day.&rdquo;
    <span class="mt-2 block not-italic text-[13px] text-navy-400">&mdash; Owner, Khems Cleaning Services</span>
  </blockquote>
</div>

<div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100/60 bg-white p-8 shadow-subtle" data-reveal>
  <blockquote class="mb-4 text-[19px] italic leading-relaxed text-[#111827]">
    &ldquo;We used to turn away bookings simply because we couldn't schedule fast enough. Now the system fills our calendar for us, including the last-minute cancellations we used to just eat as lost revenue.&rdquo;
  </blockquote>
  <p class="text-[14px] text-[#6B7280]">
    <strong class="font-semibold text-[#111827]">Owner</strong><br>
    Khems Cleaning Services
